WEBVTT

00:02.217 --> 00:06.847
[Takumi groans]

00:06.927 --> 00:10.637
<i>Rabbit, why'd you have to go</i>
<i>and get yourself arrested?</i>

00:11.477 --> 00:13.607
<i>You promised</i>
<i>to be my business sugar daddy.</i>

00:14.857 --> 00:16.817
<i>Well, at least</i>
<i>I'm a little more confident</i>

00:16.897 --> 00:18.567
<i>now that I've made</i>
<i>an epic piece of gear.</i>

00:18.647 --> 00:20.147
[grunts]

00:20.237 --> 00:21.697
[sighs]

00:21.777 --> 00:23.367
-[cell phone beeps]
-Hmm?

00:23.947 --> 00:25.077
[sighs]

00:25.157 --> 00:27.617
<i>Back to wasting my life</i>
<i>on manual labor.</i>

00:27.697 --> 00:29.827
<i>I wish I could make money</i>
<i>doing something I'm good at</i>

00:29.907 --> 00:31.787
<i>and give a shit about.</i>

00:31.867 --> 00:33.037
<i>Wait.</i>

00:33.127 --> 00:34.337
[TAKUMI'S MOM]
What did you say?!

00:34.417 --> 00:36.587
Are you telling us
you're quitting your day job?

00:36.667 --> 00:38.667
That's right.
It's time to take advantage

00:38.757 --> 00:40.507
of my skills
to make some more cash.

00:40.587 --> 00:42.677
Seriously,
name one skill that you have.

00:42.757 --> 00:45.097
So your plan is to sit around
to do nothing?

00:45.177 --> 00:48.017
No, Mom. I'm gonna make money
playing the game.

00:48.097 --> 00:49.977
I wasn't born yesterday, Takumi.

00:50.057 --> 00:51.887
You just want to slack off
and have fun.

00:51.977 --> 00:53.397
Okay, yeah, I do,

00:53.477 --> 00:56.147
but I can sell items I make
in game for real money.

00:56.227 --> 00:58.897
I'm talking, like, hundreds of
thousands of yen a month here.

00:59.937 --> 01:02.987
Takumi, I'm gonna need you
to wake up, son.

01:03.527 --> 01:06.117
If you could really make
that kind of money in a game,

01:06.197 --> 01:09.117
then you wouldn't be drowning
in a massive amount of debt.

01:09.237 --> 01:11.577
[TAKUMI] Well,
you're not entirely wrong,

01:11.657 --> 01:13.457
but listen,
I just changed classes

01:13.537 --> 01:14.707
to a legendary blacksmith.

01:14.787 --> 01:16.587
[TAKUMI'S DAD]
Stop this nonsense right now.

01:17.207 --> 01:21.217
Takumi, making a decent living
is not an easy feat.

01:21.297 --> 01:23.927
You just have to work hard
and save up every yen.

01:24.007 --> 01:25.927
Your mother and I
work hard every day

01:26.007 --> 01:27.597
to have the life that we do.

01:28.307 --> 01:30.427
You're an adult
with responsibilities.

01:30.517 --> 01:33.437
Keep working the day job
like you have been, understood?

01:35.647 --> 01:37.647
[♪ opening theme song playing]

01:56.287 --> 02:00.417
OVERGEARED

03:05.777 --> 03:06.857
[metal clanging]

03:11.077 --> 03:11.987
[sighs]

03:13.287 --> 03:14.537
[takes deep breath]

03:15.997 --> 03:16.997
[sighs]

03:17.077 --> 03:18.497
<i>For an entire month now,</i>

03:18.577 --> 03:21.877
<i>I've been grinding blacksmithing</i>
<i>every day after work.</i>

03:21.957 --> 03:23.087
<i>Some people</i>
<i>aren't built for this,</i>

03:23.167 --> 03:24.507
<i>and I'm some people.</i>

03:24.587 --> 03:27.507
I gotta find a way
to quit that soul-sucking job.

03:28.547 --> 03:31.507
Problem is, I still need to
get my family on board somehow.

03:31.597 --> 03:32.637
This sucks!

03:32.717 --> 03:35.767
Damn! If only Rabbit
hadn't gone to frickin' jail.

03:36.767 --> 03:37.687
[RABBIT] <i>Mr. Grid,</i>

03:38.557 --> 03:41.187
<i>I believe you are aware</i>
<i>of my current situation.</i>

03:41.767 --> 03:44.817
<i>I know our business</i>
<i>would have been a great success.</i>

03:44.897 --> 03:46.317
<i>I'm sorry it was cut short.</i>

03:47.067 --> 03:50.027
<i>But with your talent</i>
<i>and Kahn as your master,</i>

03:50.107 --> 03:51.737
<i>I'm sure you'll hone your skills</i>

03:51.817 --> 03:54.367
<i>and become a wealthy craftsman</i>
<i>in due time.</i>

03:54.447 --> 03:56.537
<i>I hope to hear tales</i>
<i>of your success</i>

03:56.617 --> 03:59.077
<i>blow by like leaves in the wind.</i>

03:59.497 --> 04:01.537
<i>Your friend, Rabbit.</i>

04:02.207 --> 04:03.127
[sighs]

04:03.837 --> 04:05.757
Dude, why am I so cursed?

04:05.837 --> 04:08.417
<i>Speaking of cursed,</i>
<i>what the hell happened to Huroi?</i>

04:08.507 --> 04:09.717
<i>Bro vanished.</i>

04:10.637 --> 04:12.507
And I'm also curious
about Thunder Fetus.

04:12.597 --> 04:14.257
I haven't heard from her either.

04:16.557 --> 04:17.467
FRONTIER

04:17.557 --> 04:18.767
[Euphemina sighs]
I dragged my ass

04:18.847 --> 04:20.137
all the way out to the capital,

04:20.227 --> 04:22.227
and I still can't find
a stupid recipe

04:22.307 --> 04:23.567
for a stupid orb.

04:23.647 --> 04:26.987
[indistinct chatter]

04:29.527 --> 04:30.777
[gasps]

04:30.857 --> 04:32.907
[♪ mysterious music playing]

04:48.007 --> 04:48.957
[inhales]

04:49.047 --> 04:50.717
Hey, perv. How goes it?

04:50.797 --> 04:52.137
You like what you see?

04:52.217 --> 04:54.427
Aren't you a little old
to be stalking young girls

04:54.507 --> 04:56.137
through alleyways all day?

04:56.927 --> 04:58.217
[MAN] <i>My camouflage skill</i>

04:58.307 --> 05:00.307
<i>was completely useless</i>
<i>against her.</i>

05:00.387 --> 05:02.267
You must be
the famous blacksmith

05:02.347 --> 05:03.857
who crafted an epic dagger

05:03.937 --> 05:06.687
during the item creation match
at Winston Village.

05:06.767 --> 05:08.437
We need to have a discussion.

05:08.527 --> 05:11.777
[thugs chuckling]

05:12.397 --> 05:13.987
[EUPHEMINA] Oh, goons.

05:14.067 --> 05:16.947
Is this how you normally
convince girls to talk to you?

05:17.027 --> 05:18.407
[MAN] Just tell me
what you know, kid.

05:19.287 --> 05:21.247
Did you just call me "kid"?

05:21.327 --> 05:22.247
Hmm?

05:24.827 --> 05:26.127
Angel Scream!

05:27.247 --> 05:28.797
[grunts in pain]

05:28.877 --> 05:30.087
[explosion]

05:30.167 --> 05:31.927
[thugs groaning]

05:34.297 --> 05:36.887
So then, you still
wanna have our chat?

05:36.967 --> 05:38.597
[groaning]

05:39.137 --> 05:42.267
Whoever you are,
you're definitely no blacksmith.

05:42.347 --> 05:43.517
[scoffs]

05:44.557 --> 05:46.107
[♪ tense music playing]

05:47.647 --> 05:49.017
What?

05:49.107 --> 05:50.487
This is...

05:50.567 --> 05:51.487
[gasps]

05:52.237 --> 05:53.817
-Faker!
-[running]

05:53.897 --> 05:56.067
Sorry, I screwed up.

05:56.987 --> 05:59.197
[MAN 1] She was alone,
and she beat you this bad?

05:59.277 --> 06:00.787
<i>Até parece!</i>

06:00.867 --> 06:03.037
You're the top-ranked assassin
in the whole game.

06:03.117 --> 06:05.377
How'd you get discovered
by a damn blacksmith?

06:05.457 --> 06:07.167
Kid's multi-talented.

06:07.247 --> 06:10.257
From what I saw back there,
she can use all types of skills.

06:10.337 --> 06:11.377
Are you serious?

06:12.127 --> 06:13.377
<i>Guess she might not</i>
<i>be the blacksmith</i>

06:13.467 --> 06:14.927
<i>I'm looking for after all.</i>

06:15.757 --> 06:16.677
Doesn't matter.

06:16.757 --> 06:18.807
I want you to find her and fast.

06:19.467 --> 06:21.967
We'll teach her what everyone
who crosses us learns.

06:22.057 --> 06:24.477
No one messes
with the Tzedakah Guild.

06:25.887 --> 06:27.607
-[metal clanging]
-[Kahn sighs]

06:28.357 --> 06:31.527
Young man, listen,
you should get some rest.

06:31.607 --> 06:33.187
I know. It's been like a month,

06:33.277 --> 06:34.527
and I'm still
pounding this hammer

06:34.607 --> 06:35.607
like it's your mom.

06:37.527 --> 06:38.817
<i>My level's still in hell,</i>

06:38.907 --> 06:40.987
<i>but at least I'm getting better</i>
<i>at blacksmithing.</i>

06:42.197 --> 06:44.077
<i>The items I've made</i>
<i>are starting to sell,</i>

06:44.157 --> 06:46.287
<i>and people seem</i>
<i>pretty happy with them.</i>

06:47.167 --> 06:48.207
<i>What totally blows</i>

06:48.287 --> 06:50.417
<i>is that most of the gear</i>
<i>I've crafted is normal.</i>

06:50.497 --> 06:52.417
<i>Which means normal money.</i>

06:52.507 --> 06:55.177
<i>I've barely shat out</i>
<i>three epics.</i>

06:55.257 --> 06:57.007
Damn it.
This is supposed to be my thing.

06:57.087 --> 06:58.757
I'm the legendary blacksmith!

06:58.837 --> 07:01.757
Stupid-ass devs holding me back
with your busted RNG!

07:01.847 --> 07:05.267
I'll call the consumer
protection agency!

07:06.097 --> 07:08.517
[MAN] Hey, chief. You might
wanna take a look at this.

07:08.607 --> 07:10.647
What's up? Someone mad?

07:10.727 --> 07:13.737
The probability of crafting
better items increases

07:13.817 --> 07:15.067
as you level up your character.

07:15.527 --> 07:17.567
What is this guy
even complaining about?

07:17.647 --> 07:18.737
[HINAKO] Isn't it obvious?

07:18.817 --> 07:21.487
He's upset because he doesn't
understand basic math.

07:21.577 --> 07:25.327
Yeah, but if he's only crafted
three epic items

07:25.407 --> 07:27.537
despite having legendary skills,

07:27.617 --> 07:28.827
I can't say I blame the guy

07:28.917 --> 07:30.377
for thinking that
we're cheating him.

07:30.457 --> 07:33.707
Okay, sure,
but I don't see any errors,

07:33.797 --> 07:35.507
and the success rate
is unchanged.

07:36.167 --> 07:39.547
Personally, I think this guy
just has terrible luck.

07:40.297 --> 07:41.807
[TAKUMI] <i>Let's see.</i>

07:41.887 --> 07:44.717
<i>How much would the items</i>
<i>I've made so far sell for?</i>

07:45.307 --> 07:50.727
<i>If you subtract the mat costs,</i>
<i>I've earned 129,480 yen.</i>

07:53.317 --> 07:56.357
<i>I was only grinding at night,</i>
<i>and I made that much in a month?</i>

07:56.437 --> 07:58.067
<i>If I did it all day,</i>
<i>there's no telling</i>

07:58.147 --> 07:59.487
<i>how much more I'd make.</i>

07:59.987 --> 08:04.697
If only my frickin' mom and dad
would understand! [growls]

08:04.787 --> 08:05.697
Hmm?

08:05.787 --> 08:07.077
THE ULTIMATE CAPSULE CAFÉ

08:07.157 --> 08:08.827
CUSTOMERS WHO REGISTER ON 9/10
LIFETIME 30% OFF CAPSULE USE

08:08.907 --> 08:10.577
[♪ dramatic music playing]

08:10.667 --> 08:12.537
<i>What? That's balls cheap!</i>

08:12.627 --> 08:14.207
<i>You mean I can pretend</i>
<i>I'm at work</i>

08:14.297 --> 08:16.547
<i>and play the game</i>
<i>all day instead?!</i>

08:16.627 --> 08:17.967
-[chuckles]
-[gasps]

08:18.047 --> 08:18.967
RACE FORWARD!
A SHINING TOMORROW - DREAMS

08:19.047 --> 08:21.467
[panting, chuckling]

08:21.547 --> 08:23.427
CAPSULE CAFÉ

08:23.507 --> 08:27.597
<i>Goodbye, broke-ass day labor,</i>
<i>and hello, new office.</i>

08:28.557 --> 08:30.137
[indistinct chatter]

08:30.227 --> 08:31.807
Wow, that's amazing!

08:31.897 --> 08:33.267
The stats are 20% better

08:33.357 --> 08:35.397
than all the other gear
of the same level!

08:35.477 --> 08:37.107
Is this it, or do you have more?

08:37.187 --> 08:40.027
This is all we got
for the time being.

08:40.107 --> 08:43.617
We use only the best materials
and take our time, you see.

08:47.787 --> 08:50.077
[TAKUMI] <i>I'm logged in</i>
<i>15 hours a day total,</i>

08:50.157 --> 08:51.707
<i>including my time</i>
<i>at the capsule café,</i>

08:51.787 --> 08:54.037
<i>and now,</i>
<i>after 20 hours of labor,</i>

08:54.127 --> 08:56.297
<i>I have my perfect shiny baby.</i>

08:56.377 --> 08:57.757
<i>I hope it's legendary,</i>

08:57.837 --> 08:59.587
<i>or at the very least, unique.</i>

09:00.047 --> 09:01.507
<i>Please!</i>

09:05.547 --> 09:07.007
VERY DELICATE PLATE ARMOR
CLASS: EPIC

09:07.097 --> 09:09.057
[yelling frustratedly]

09:09.137 --> 09:10.057
Hmm?

09:11.017 --> 09:12.687
Oi, what's wrong?

09:12.767 --> 09:15.267
You've crafted
a fine piece of armor.

09:15.357 --> 09:17.227
It's a fine piece of shit.
It's only an epic.

09:17.317 --> 09:19.527
How much do you think
it'll sell for?

09:19.607 --> 09:21.947
Hmm. Hard to say with certainty.

09:22.027 --> 09:24.617
Maybe you could put it up
for auction at the castle.

09:24.697 --> 09:26.777
Up for auction, huh?

09:26.867 --> 09:28.577
Yeah. If they knew I sent you,

09:28.657 --> 09:30.997
they'll probably let you
skip the paperwork.

09:31.077 --> 09:35.247
Temper your expectations,
and it'll be a good experience.

09:36.337 --> 09:38.757
[GAME VOICE] <i>You obtained</i>
<i>"Proof of Kahn's Successor."</i>

09:39.417 --> 09:41.257
[TAKUMI] Trust me,
I won't get my hopes up.

09:41.337 --> 09:45.007
When ol' Lady Luck screws me,
it's never with the lights on.

09:45.097 --> 09:47.507
♪

09:48.927 --> 09:50.057
[indistinct chatter]

09:50.137 --> 09:52.427
You're kidding, right?
She wouldn't tell me.

09:53.187 --> 09:54.097
[sighs]

09:54.477 --> 09:55.687
<i>The plate armor</i>
<i>is the main thing</i>

09:55.767 --> 09:57.017
<i>I'm putting up for auction,</i>

09:57.107 --> 09:59.187
<i>but I can also toss in</i>
<i>these little beauties</i>

09:59.267 --> 10:00.277
<i>that I just finished.</i>

10:00.897 --> 10:03.107
<i>Hmm.</i>
<i>What should my starting bid be?</i>

10:03.527 --> 10:05.947
<i>If it's too high,</i>
<i>it's not gonna sell.</i>

10:06.027 --> 10:07.487
-[MAN] Hello.
-Hmm?

10:07.577 --> 10:09.487
Nice to meet you. I'm Steng.

10:09.577 --> 10:11.907
I'm just here running an errand
for my master,

10:11.997 --> 10:13.497
but if there's anything
you don't understand,

10:13.577 --> 10:14.917
I'd be happy to help you.

10:14.997 --> 10:16.877
[TAKUMI] <i>Whose hamster is this?</i>
<i>Is he another player?</i>

10:17.627 --> 10:19.457
Uh, hey, champ. [chuckles]

10:19.547 --> 10:22.297
What's the normal starting bid
for an item around level 120?

10:22.377 --> 10:25.927
Well, for a normal one,
it'd be around 300 gold.

10:26.007 --> 10:27.347
Okay. What if it's an epic?

10:27.427 --> 10:29.297
Oh, an epic item?

10:29.387 --> 10:31.057
A glove would go for around 600,

10:31.137 --> 10:34.307
but a piece of armor would
be sure to go for over 1,800.

10:34.387 --> 10:35.687
[TAKUMI] <i>2,400 gold?</i>

10:35.767 --> 10:37.807
<i>That's like 290,000 yen!</i>

10:38.557 --> 10:40.857
<i>If your boy can drop these epics</i>
<i>for that much,</i>

10:40.937 --> 10:42.937
<i>I'm gonna be one rich bitch!</i>

10:43.567 --> 10:44.777
[chuckles nervously]

10:45.857 --> 10:48.157
-[TAKUMI] Uh, what's wrong?
-[STENG] Uh, nothing.

10:53.157 --> 10:55.407
[STENG] Hey, Grid,
the bidding just ended.

10:55.957 --> 10:57.957
They're gonna tell us
what was sold.

10:58.037 --> 10:59.127
Huh?

11:00.537 --> 11:02.127
[WOMAN] May I have
your attention, please?

11:02.207 --> 11:05.877
Of all the items listed today,
only six were sold.

11:05.967 --> 11:07.757
-What?!
-Just six?

11:07.837 --> 11:08.757
You're kidding, right?

11:08.847 --> 11:12.507
There's Claris's necklace,
453 gold,

11:13.177 --> 11:16.937
Grace's armor padding,
which sold for 189 gold,

11:17.017 --> 11:21.017
then Figret's healing items,
which sold for 15 gold apiece,

11:21.107 --> 11:23.397
and of course,
Steng's longsword,

11:23.487 --> 11:25.277
which sold for 1,900.

11:25.357 --> 11:26.737
[gasps] Huzzah!

11:26.817 --> 11:29.447
My master will be
so pleased with me, right?

11:29.527 --> 11:30.527
Don't you think so?

11:30.617 --> 11:32.947
Dude, I don't know you,
and I don't know your master.

11:33.037 --> 11:34.197
How the shit should I know?

11:34.287 --> 11:36.537
[STENG] Oh, right.
You got me there.

11:36.617 --> 11:39.917
Lastly, is the one
they call Grid still here?

11:39.997 --> 11:42.377
Uh, yeah. They call me that.

11:42.457 --> 11:44.957
The administrator wishes
to speak to you.

11:45.507 --> 11:46.757
Follow me, good sir.

11:46.837 --> 11:48.887
[STENG] Oh, wow.
I'm sure it's good news!

11:48.967 --> 11:50.047
I bet they're just itching

11:50.137 --> 11:52.007
to tell you how much
they admire your work!

11:52.597 --> 11:54.887
Yeah? You super sure about that?

11:58.267 --> 11:59.557
[MAN] Word travels fast.

11:59.647 --> 12:01.477
I've heard a great deal
about you.

12:01.557 --> 12:04.017
It seems Kahn has proven
quite the teacher.

12:04.607 --> 12:05.777
[TAKUMI] <i>Yeah,</i>
<i>that's mostly my own skill,</i>

12:05.857 --> 12:07.277
<i>but who's keeping score?</i>

12:07.357 --> 12:09.527
I don't intend
to keep you here long.

12:09.607 --> 12:12.447
I wish to purchase the armor
and gauntlets you've crafted.

12:12.527 --> 12:14.537
Will 5,500 gold suffice?

12:16.497 --> 12:19.577
[TAKUMI] <i>5,500, carry the five,</i>
<i>slap the ass,</i>

12:19.667 --> 12:23.167
<i>and that's 660,000 yen!</i>

12:23.247 --> 12:25.417
And I would like more
than just armor.

12:25.507 --> 12:27.337
I also require weapons.

12:27.417 --> 12:29.967
Three swords, and I need them
all within a week.

12:30.047 --> 12:32.927
I will accept nothing less
than epic quality armaments.

12:33.007 --> 12:34.047
[TAKUMI] <i>Oh, come on.</i>

12:34.137 --> 12:35.057
[GAME VOICE] <i>A quest</i>
<i>has been generated.</i>

12:35.137 --> 12:37.267
[TAKUMI] <i>I almost never get</i>
<i>anything but normal quality.</i>

12:37.347 --> 12:39.687
<i>I'd have to be a complete idiot</i>
<i>to accept this one.</i>

12:39.767 --> 12:43.687
Of course, I'm willing
to pay well above market rates.

12:43.767 --> 12:47.437
[Takumi breathing heavily]

12:48.527 --> 12:49.817
<i>I...</i>

12:49.897 --> 12:52.027
<i>I accepted it.</i>

12:52.117 --> 12:53.367
<i>And now all I have to do</i>

12:53.447 --> 12:57.077
<i>is craft three epic items</i>
<i>in one week!</i>

12:57.157 --> 12:58.787
[sighs]

13:01.367 --> 13:03.537
Oh, wow.
I'm sure it's good news!

13:03.627 --> 13:04.587
I bet they're just itching

13:04.667 --> 13:06.497
to tell you how much
they admire your work!

13:07.507 --> 13:10.047
Little guy was so happy,
you'd think they asked him.

13:11.677 --> 13:13.507
I guess I have to do it now.

13:15.047 --> 13:18.097
I'm not taking the L
before I even start. Hell nah.

13:19.677 --> 13:22.347
[groans]

13:22.437 --> 13:24.607
STURDY LONGSWORD
CLASS: NORMAL - ATTACK

13:28.147 --> 13:30.987
Oh, that's a wonderful blade.

13:31.067 --> 13:33.157
What? That shit isn't wonderful!

13:33.237 --> 13:34.697
It's frickin' normal-ful!

13:34.777 --> 13:37.657
Son, why are you so hysterical?
You did well.

13:37.737 --> 13:40.537
Because I've only got the mats
to make seven swords, Kahn,

13:40.617 --> 13:43.917
and the first one sucked ass,
so I might as well just die!

13:45.127 --> 13:48.297
True effort will never
turn its back on you.

13:48.377 --> 13:50.797
Give it your all
and believe in yourself.

13:51.467 --> 13:52.877
Yeah, I think you're right.

13:53.587 --> 13:56.047
[groans]

13:57.677 --> 14:00.767
Uh, true effort never
turns its back unless--

14:00.847 --> 14:02.557
No, shut up! Not another word!

14:02.637 --> 14:05.767
Epic, unique, legendary!

14:05.857 --> 14:08.187
Epic, unique, legendary!

14:08.267 --> 14:09.567
[growls]

14:09.647 --> 14:11.687
Epic, unique, legendary!

14:11.777 --> 14:13.817
Epic, unique, legendary!

14:13.897 --> 14:15.117
[yells frustratedly]

14:15.197 --> 14:16.867
Epic, unique, legendary!

14:16.947 --> 14:18.327
Epic, unique, legendary!

14:18.407 --> 14:20.447
Epic, unique, legendary!

14:20.537 --> 14:23.117
-Epic, unique, legendary!
-[rapid clanging]

14:23.207 --> 14:25.747
[KAHN] Well,
you turned out three normals,

14:25.827 --> 14:28.877
a rare, and two epics,
which isn't bad.

14:28.957 --> 14:30.047
Hmm.

14:30.507 --> 14:32.377
[TAKUMI] This is the last one.

14:32.967 --> 14:35.637
Moment of truth.
Are you all right?

14:36.257 --> 14:38.847
I've never felt better
in my entire life

14:38.927 --> 14:41.137
because I'm going to quit
and then die.

14:41.217 --> 14:42.597
You can't think like that.

14:42.677 --> 14:44.637
You're the successor of Pagma.

14:45.307 --> 14:46.687
[giggles]

14:46.767 --> 14:49.647
It's funny 'cause
I'm a successor with no success.

14:52.187 --> 14:54.607
<i>My heart is already empty.</i>

14:55.147 --> 14:57.367
<i>I shall wish for no more.</i>

14:58.027 --> 14:59.407
[crackling]

14:59.487 --> 15:00.657
[gasps]

15:00.737 --> 15:02.157
This... This is...

15:06.077 --> 15:07.207
[booming]

15:09.127 --> 15:11.797
Damn! Zeus, don't tase me, bro!

15:13.047 --> 15:14.047
♪

15:14.127 --> 15:15.717
SWORD OF SELF-TRANSCENDENCE
CLASS: LEGENDARY

15:15.797 --> 15:16.717
[TAKUMI] Huh?

15:17.297 --> 15:18.637
[GAME VOICE]
<i>Crafting a legendary item</i>

15:18.717 --> 15:20.467
<i>has awarded you</i>
<i>a permanent bonus</i>

15:20.547 --> 15:23.267
<i>of 25 points to all your stats.</i>

15:23.347 --> 15:25.347
<i>Your fame will increase</i>
<i>by 1,000 points</i>

15:25.427 --> 15:26.847
<i>across the continent.</i>

15:26.937 --> 15:29.977
<i>You have earned the title</i>
<i>"The Only Legendary Crafter."</i>

15:30.557 --> 15:31.937
[stunned gasp]

15:34.067 --> 15:35.817
-[grunts]
-[body thuds]

15:35.897 --> 15:37.817
[TAKUMI] Kahn!

15:38.567 --> 15:40.867
[man panting weakly]

15:41.907 --> 15:44.537
[grunts] The blood witch
is too strong.

15:44.997 --> 15:46.247
She's unstoppable.

15:46.907 --> 15:48.167
[groans weakly]

15:48.627 --> 15:52.087
Master Doran,
I could not avenge you, sir.

15:52.167 --> 15:54.167
I'm sorry I've failed you.

15:56.837 --> 16:00.137
[laughs] Now we shall
dismember your corpse

16:00.217 --> 16:02.137
and offer your flesh to Yatan.

16:02.807 --> 16:05.597
[YURA] <i>Ugh, I'd mod</i>
<i>these Yatan cult NPCs</i>

16:05.677 --> 16:07.387
<i>out of existence if I could.</i>

16:08.057 --> 16:10.937
<i>But if I can't get</i>
<i>a class change book like Roy,</i>

16:11.017 --> 16:13.897
<i>I'll never be able to keep up</i>
<i>with the higher-ranked classes.</i>

16:14.817 --> 16:17.527
<i>I need to focus,</i>
<i>clear this SS-ranked quest,</i>

16:17.607 --> 16:19.657
<i>and get myself</i>
<i>some powerful new skills.</i>

16:20.407 --> 16:23.327
<i>I'll show them</i>
<i>I'm more than just a black mage.</i>

16:23.407 --> 16:26.657
<i>I'll become the top-ranked</i>
<i>player in the game.</i>

16:27.747 --> 16:29.667
[IRENE] So,
the force we sent was...

16:29.747 --> 16:31.127
[KNIGHT] Annihilated.

16:31.207 --> 16:33.417
The cultists were few,
as reported.

16:33.497 --> 16:36.167
But it seems they had
the blood witch on their side.

16:36.257 --> 16:37.217
[gasps]

16:38.627 --> 16:40.337
Well, we can't give up now.

16:40.927 --> 16:42.967
Hurry and fortify
our troops' equipment.

16:44.557 --> 16:48.227
<i>Doran,</i>
<i>I swear I shall avenge you.</i>

16:48.307 --> 16:50.477
[TAKUMI] Well, looky
what I found!

16:50.557 --> 16:52.557
Your boy got himself
a gold coin!

16:52.687 --> 16:55.017
Holy shit,
I'm like a money magnet now.

16:55.107 --> 16:57.027
Lady Luck,
you finally stopped teasing me.

16:57.107 --> 16:59.027
You're not homeless anymore,
little guy.

16:59.107 --> 17:00.237
Get in this wallet.

17:00.817 --> 17:03.697
[MAN] Good Lady Irene,
may I present Grid,

17:03.777 --> 17:05.487
the craftsman I have employed.

17:05.577 --> 17:07.327
He is the same citizen
who uncovered

17:07.407 --> 17:09.577
the Mero Company's evil plot.

17:09.657 --> 17:11.707
[IRENE] Oh,
so you're the blacksmith

17:11.787 --> 17:13.377
everyone's talking about.

17:13.457 --> 17:14.707
I had every intention

17:14.787 --> 17:16.547
of rewarding
your good deeds sooner,

17:16.627 --> 17:19.547
-but I've been busy as of late.
-[MAN] My lady,

17:19.627 --> 17:21.177
feast your eyes
on the greatsword

17:21.257 --> 17:22.837
he crafted for us.

17:22.927 --> 17:25.597
That... That sword! Astounding!

17:25.677 --> 17:27.137
[Irene gasps]

17:27.217 --> 17:28.347
[TAKUMI] So?

17:31.307 --> 17:33.307
How much will Your Highness
pay for it?

17:33.397 --> 17:35.267
It is a legendary item,

17:35.357 --> 17:37.277
so I assume
you'll pay me in kind.

17:37.357 --> 17:39.817
Sir Phoenix, what say you?

17:39.897 --> 17:42.067
Can we defeat the blood witch
with this sword?

17:42.947 --> 17:45.697
She will stand no chance
against this blade.

17:46.277 --> 17:48.697
[IRENE] Then there's no need
to keep our new friend waiting.

17:48.787 --> 17:51.707
I shall let the administrator
determine the price.

17:52.497 --> 17:54.287
Grid, I believe it was?

17:54.377 --> 17:55.707
Well met, Grid.

17:55.787 --> 17:57.837
May our partnership
be prosperous.

17:58.377 --> 17:59.297
[TAKUMI] <i>Huh?</i>

18:00.627 --> 18:03.007
<i>I think I've seen that ring</i>
<i>somewhere before.</i>

18:04.337 --> 18:05.797
<i>Well, whatever.</i>

18:05.887 --> 18:08.307
<i>For now,</i>
<i>I just like that she's willing</i>

18:08.387 --> 18:10.557
<i>to shell out that cash.</i>

18:10.637 --> 18:13.267
[MAN] We'll pay
220,000 gold for it.

18:13.347 --> 18:15.147
What the hell, man?

18:15.227 --> 18:18.317
It's worth a lot more than...
Sorry, thousand?

18:18.397 --> 18:19.477
[gasping]

18:21.237 --> 18:23.277
<i>220,000 gold?</i>

18:23.357 --> 18:26.027
<i>That's 26.4 million yen!</i>

18:26.947 --> 18:28.537
<i>I can buy myself</i>
<i>a baller-ass ride</i>

18:28.617 --> 18:30.117
<i>and show up</i>
<i>to the class reunions</i>

18:30.197 --> 18:31.367
<i>I've been avoiding!</i>

18:31.447 --> 18:33.327
<i>Oh, my first crush, Arisa,</i>
<i>will be there,</i>

18:33.407 --> 18:34.917
<i>and I shall woo her.</i>

18:35.497 --> 18:39.337
<i>Ah! All those years of suffering</i>
<i>paved the path to this moment!</i>

18:39.417 --> 18:40.667
[chuckling]

18:41.087 --> 18:43.047
Where do I sign?
You've got a deal.

18:43.127 --> 18:45.047
Hmm. Thank you, sir.

18:45.137 --> 18:48.217
Consider this a small gift
for doing business with us.

18:48.297 --> 18:49.637
Blue Orichalcum.

18:49.717 --> 18:51.807
I'm sure you'll put it
to good use.

18:52.387 --> 18:54.437
[TAKUMI] <i>Huh? That's</i>
<i>the rare material I needed</i>

18:54.517 --> 18:55.887
<i>for the sword I tried to make.</i>

18:55.977 --> 18:58.307
<i>I'm probably not at the point</i>
<i>where I can try that again,</i>

18:58.397 --> 18:59.517
<i>but damn, I'm lucky!</i>

18:59.937 --> 19:01.187
Thanks, Uncle Moneystache.

19:01.277 --> 19:04.187
I believe that concludes
our business for now.

19:04.277 --> 19:05.197
Ah.

19:05.647 --> 19:06.777
[GAME VOICE] <i>Quest clear.</i>

19:06.867 --> 19:09.617
<i>You have earned a ranking</i>
<i>as an additional bonus.</i>

19:09.697 --> 19:12.997
<i>You are no longer required</i>
<i>to pay taxes in Winston.</i>

19:13.077 --> 19:15.787
[TAKUMI] <i>Hah! This is</i>
<i>the greatest feeling.</i>

19:15.867 --> 19:18.957
<i>I can't wait to rub this</i>
<i>in Mom and Dad's dumb faces.</i>

19:19.037 --> 19:19.957
GRID - JOB PAGMA'S SUCCESSOR
TITLE LEGENDARY ONE

19:20.047 --> 19:21.207
[MAN] Yeesh.

19:21.297 --> 19:23.047
So is anybody
gonna break it to this kid

19:23.127 --> 19:25.007
that he didn't
just win the lottery?

19:25.087 --> 19:27.717
I'd say he just
lost money, actually.

19:27.797 --> 19:29.177
Here in a few months,

19:29.257 --> 19:31.597
tons of users will be able
to equip a legendary

19:31.677 --> 19:33.217
like the Sword of Transcendence.

19:33.307 --> 19:36.437
The demand will be higher,
and it'll go for a lot more.

19:36.517 --> 19:38.187
Like, a lot, lot more.

19:38.727 --> 19:40.607
As in several
hundred million yen.

19:41.317 --> 19:43.147
[MAN] He really
does have shit luck.

19:44.937 --> 19:47.607
NAGAMINE GREENGROCERS

19:48.317 --> 19:50.077
[humming]

19:50.157 --> 19:51.367
Guess who's home!

19:51.487 --> 19:53.327
Anybody achin' for some bacon--

19:53.407 --> 19:55.867
Oh, what the hell happened here?

19:56.617 --> 19:59.327
Takumi, a while back,

19:59.417 --> 20:02.497
Dad agreed to be a guarantor on
a friend's loan to help him out.

20:02.587 --> 20:03.797
Huh?

20:03.877 --> 20:05.007
[SEIRA] And now he's on the hook

20:05.087 --> 20:07.167
for paying off
his outstanding debt.

20:07.257 --> 20:08.757
80 million yen.

20:09.887 --> 20:11.007
[TAKUMI] Huh?

20:11.597 --> 20:15.807
Look, if we... if we just sell
the house and empty our savings,

20:15.887 --> 20:17.767
that's 40 million yen
right there.

20:18.517 --> 20:21.647
All those years I saved money
for Seira's college,

20:21.727 --> 20:23.607
her coming-of-age ceremony,
her wedding.

20:23.687 --> 20:25.897
-Hmm?
-[TAKUMI'S DAD] I'm so sorry.

20:25.977 --> 20:27.357
-[crying]
-[SEIRA] Dad, it's okay.

20:27.437 --> 20:28.777
I don't have to go to college.

20:28.857 --> 20:31.237
Hey, I'm your kid too.
Did you save anything for me?

20:31.317 --> 20:35.407
I am so sorry we couldn't be
better examples for you, Seira!

20:35.487 --> 20:37.287
[SEIRA] It's okay, Mom!
Everything's gonna be all right!

20:37.367 --> 20:38.787
Please forgive me for
what I've done to you, Seira!

20:38.867 --> 20:39.787
[TAKUMI] You guys, I...

20:40.827 --> 20:41.997
Wait, am I, like,

20:42.087 --> 20:44.797
living in one of those movies
where I was dead all along?

20:44.877 --> 20:45.997
[all crying]

20:49.837 --> 20:51.177
Guys, relax.

20:51.257 --> 20:52.757
I'll earn that 80 million
for you.

20:52.847 --> 20:53.847
[ALL] Huh?

20:54.597 --> 20:57.017
[all continue crying]

20:57.097 --> 20:58.517
[TAKUMI] Enough! Remember me,

20:58.597 --> 21:00.597
the son who said
he'd make money playing games?

21:00.687 --> 21:02.937
I made more than 20 million yen!

21:03.517 --> 21:06.107
[TAKUMI'S DAD]
Huh? What did you say?

21:09.067 --> 21:11.697
There's really 20 million yen
in here.

21:11.777 --> 21:13.027
Oh, honey, what did you do?

21:13.117 --> 21:14.157
[SEIRA] Did you break the law?

21:14.237 --> 21:15.907
Where are the guns?
Where are they?!

21:15.987 --> 21:17.997
I'm not a freaking criminal.
I earned it in-game.

21:18.077 --> 21:18.997
Chill the hell out.

21:19.617 --> 21:20.787
[both sigh in relief]

21:23.327 --> 21:25.497
I see now
what you were trying to tell me.

21:25.587 --> 21:26.997
I'm sorry, son.

21:27.087 --> 21:28.757
Thanks, Dad.

21:28.837 --> 21:31.467
You put a lot of work
into that game, didn't you?

21:32.217 --> 21:34.217
I couldn't be prouder
if I tried.

21:34.297 --> 21:36.137
But are you sure about this?

21:36.217 --> 21:37.387
[TAKUMI] Of course.

21:37.467 --> 21:38.597
Use it, Dad.

21:38.677 --> 21:40.057
Thank you, son.

21:40.137 --> 21:42.517
I think we should be able
to repay this debt now.

21:43.187 --> 21:46.067
I'll pay back the rest
and your 24 million yen myself.

21:46.147 --> 21:48.227
Just give me three years.
That's all I'll need.

21:48.317 --> 21:50.027
Oh, come on, we're family.

21:50.107 --> 21:51.357
Don't worry about it.

21:51.447 --> 21:56.157
Also, it's not just 24 million,
it's 24,800,000, thank you.

21:56.237 --> 21:57.737
[TAKUMI'S DAD] Uh, right.

21:57.827 --> 21:59.827
[TAKUMI] <i>Man,</i>
<i>they finally respect me.</i>

21:59.907 --> 22:00.867
[TAKUMI'S MOM]
I'll work really hard too.

22:00.947 --> 22:03.457
-We'll do whatever it takes.
-[SEIRA] Yeah. Me too.

22:03.537 --> 22:05.587
[TAKUMI] <i>He's still</i>
<i>over 50 million in the hole,</i>

22:05.667 --> 22:06.957
<i>but it doesn't matter.</i>

22:07.047 --> 22:08.997
<i>I'll do what I can</i>
<i>to help my family.</i>

22:10.457 --> 22:12.467
[♪ closing theme song playing]
